{"version":1,"key":"article:15","content":{"id":15,"title":"Ajax跨域","author":"","content":[{"children":[{"text":"本篇文章介绍什么是跨域，以及跨域的解决办法。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"05f4e5af-0ed6-4df3-8033-da8cb243c9b0","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"同源策略","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7087d3bd-9a37-4a10-aac8-68a407a860b2","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"什么是同源策略：同 domain(或IP)，同端口，同协议视为同一个域，一个域内的脚本仅仅具有本域内的权限，可以理解为本域脚本只能读写本域内的资源，而无法访问其它域的资源，这种安全限制称为同源策略。我们看几个例子判断两个链接是否是同源","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"06365e33-3782-40b2-94da-c1e0d1fe0ea2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"url1","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5cc416a7-cd13-4454-8ce9-7c6c0f88d75f","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"url2","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b821d65b-4d8f-4eae-9ea3-879860de4c1f","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"是否同源","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6ca5fbb0-f26a-4570-91d1-ea6a98544e9e","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"原因","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b213ec8b-8a59-4500-984f-355c3e34981c","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"}],"collabId":"f7aa3516-4958-4afe-9402-2f621db05cae","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","type":"table-row"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"http://example.com:8080","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"aedd8fe8-937e-4c72-8eb8-e2bf6475e33c","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"http://example.com:80","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7a7f0f66-ab8d-4e5b-895e-de9f127d9558","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"否","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3080a0c7-8363-4f8e-b86e-1b2e69626726","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"端口不同","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f00c35da-fb2a-4d89-a21c-fdd49325dacb","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"}],"collabId":"51c943bd-84cc-43bc-8921-94529ad4354a","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","type":"table-row"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"http://example.com:8080","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b3637fe7-feab-4cbb-b8cd-34aa6c1031eb","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"https://example.com:8080","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a3f54073-369f-48f1-8916-7c6bc69e5a4c","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"否","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d5c2edd9-1397-4fd2-8a5e-1c9b36427960","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"协议不同","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9505543e-90d7-4e50-a0d2-f39387d8a639","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"}],"collabId":"d1fbe6cd-b9fb-4fd6-aba0-65aa14dfdb27","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","type":"table-row"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"http://www.baidu.com","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3a7e40b4-e5fe-4baf-88e0-74c03129893d","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"http://www.taobao.com","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d3d634b8-1c57-4c95-927f-99b75999d6a1","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"否","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"bb6db114-b2a1-4f92-bb76-2c249fb59191","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"域名不同","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"da438350-8224-41bf-a2e0-f66930d19eb5","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"}],"collabId":"1e559020-43d7-4f08-a7a3-b855a20c6a4e","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","type":"table-row"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"http://127.0.0.1:8080","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"43ee3638-b9bf-4ccf-9d24-484ad692cb60","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"http://localhost:8080","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"43afa840-9015-4d60-944a-7fc689a58de2","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"否","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"736cd5c7-f797-47a2-b7de-0269962f51ea","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"域名与域名对应的IP地址不同源","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"12d4478a-d10c-404b-8f88-87c4c82861f6","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"}],"collabId":"ece12311-9f25-47e1-a010-324c615ea1f4","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","type":"table-row"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"http://example.com:8000/a.js","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c59e01f1-5e10-4980-adc0-7c299f2d52cb","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"http://example.com:8000/b.js","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b41ec72a-9567-4c48-83ad-40d20dafaf7d","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"是","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3212727a-2a5a-493c-a62d-165553d98919","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"协议，域名，端口相同，子域名不同","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2c509a5a-1d96-451a-8edc-3e00220c3523","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"}],"collabId":"d06443c1-448e-457b-9208-b8247d5e9a66","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","type":"table-row"}],"collabId":"1ff09c42-ff1c-4eb2-b338-4eae9f9c1dc2","tauContract":"6b49184b8918108ccf1636963138d105f679894dfe0d7b7abd75a6e6db67056b","type":"table"},{"children":[{"text":"我们首先启动一个 Node 程序作为服务端，启动在本地的 4000 端口，如下","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"546f5deb-f2bb-4516-8c6f-0d42a63e95e1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const http = require('http');\n\nconst server = http.createServer();\n\nserver.on('request', function(req, res) {\n    res.end('hello world');\n})\n\nserver.listen(4000, function() {\n    console.log('服务启动在4000端口...');\n})","collabId":"87b16c3f-fb79-4355-9f43-63753dca30e4","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"6d327fbf-09c8-4d44-b09f-1eca876ef695","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"dc92e1eb-de80-4ffc-aeb4-dcc4eae2ec2b"},{"children":[{"text":"现在我们同时在本地的 5501 端口启动一个静态服务器显示网页，在网页中我们发起一个 ajax 请求，向本地的 4000 端口请求数据，即我们刚刚搭的 Node 程序","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ac3a2fda-7bd7-464f-a146-c50a82a0f106","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const xhr = new XMLHttpRequest();\nxhr.onreadystatechange = function () { \n    if (xhr.readyState == 4 && xhr.status == 200) {\n        console.log(xhr.responseText);\n    } \n }\n xhr.onerror = function() {\n     console.error('出错了')\n }\nxhr.open('get', 'http://127.0.0.1:4000');\nxhr.send(null);","collabId":"7c9e5206-60eb-457b-b285-b0946f964464","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"63513a8e-6f57-4dd5-a6cf-dbccb1f911c2","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"0d09104d-f0ad-4464-83e9-6108e875d009"},{"children":[{"text":"这个时候我们打开控制台，发现给出这样的错误信息","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cff303db-b7cc-4345-8d2f-0e9c9597f422","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"borderRadius":"none","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f2b21ed6-70e0-4271-8893-b4cd89c326a4","naturalHeight":75,"naturalWidth":1354,"pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_21e4e682-0ce1-4a77-bf1d-d428d414935b.webp","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_21e4e682-0ce1-4a77-bf1d-d428d414935b.webp","uuid":"9fd5c57a-3338-451d-8074-645a3d1a1f3f","width":822.8571428571429},{"children":[{"text":"因为网页的地址 http://127.0.0.1:5501 与服务器的地址 http://127.0.0.1:4000 它们的域名是不同的，所以它们是不同源的，所以这个请求是跨域的请求，而浏览器是不允许跨域请求的。那么浏览器为什么会提出同源策略，这是出于安全的考虑。同源策略包括两种：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"042affc6-3547-4a8b-8e27-cd84449d1266","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"DOM 同源策略：禁止对不同源页面 DOM 进行操作，这里主要场景是 iframe 跨域的情况，不同域名的 iframe 是限制互相访问的","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ff9d1547-9acd-41dd-8740-2bb1dbf4ba1f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"77ee6b76-8f97-4cf9-8ac1-562375559d76","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"XMLHttpRequest 同源策略：禁止使用 xhr 对象向不同源的服务器地址发起 HTTP 请求","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6dd465a6-c6df-4ebf-97bf-4fa6491e605e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"4737188c-b71e-430e-be2b-36fa7580b057","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"2a6e7b8e-e4e0-44ff-ba07-cf8ffe2b5bdb","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","type":"numbered-list"},{"children":[{"text":"在这里我们只关注 ajax 跨域，我们来看一下如果没有同源策略会有什么危害：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d2421d0b-b3f1-4898-ba72-e18070a32589","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"用户登录了自己的银行页面 http://mybank.com， http://mybank.com 向用户的 cookie 中添加用户标识","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"67683c81-2861-4219-950f-410c4737d224","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"5c61c428-272b-4100-9b20-6ce9b52e41a9","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"用户浏览了恶意页面 http://evil.com， 执行了页面中的恶意 AJAX 请求代码","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3bdd9eca-2a42-4b4b-a755-924a7a88cdaa","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"36bb8273-7301-488d-8107-6f76f3a5dfb7","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"http://evil.com 向 http://mybank.com 发起 AJAX HTTP 请求，请求会默认把 http://mybank.com 对应 cookie 也同时发送过去","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a83c6c12-26a5-4832-addd-e6107f6f06b7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"8a8a8638-91be-4f6b-92e2-9468a6313051","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"银行页面从发送的 cookie 中提取用户标识，验证用户无误，response 中返回请求数据，此时数据就泄露了","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8fcb5eea-df4f-463a-80ae-57281ba8793d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"8d6b08f7-317b-4c9a-a49f-eec30b872ac9","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"而且由于 Ajax 在后台执行，用户无法感知这一过程","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5c3c58a5-5099-4bac-a20a-868249d68f61","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"132cc771-932e-4202-95ad-bfe9f2689630","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"9b154739-8f9b-4371-bb33-1c49da0d6eec","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","type":"numbered-list"},{"children":[{"text":"所以有了同源策略我们才能够安全的上网，但是很多时候我们还是有跨域的需求的，并且现在随着前后端分离的流行，前端与后端的不同源是很有可能，所以迫切需要解决这个问题，下面就介绍两种跨域的方法。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9dcf2359-f7e6-4765-a566-78f750233fb1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"JSONP","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c0d5d80a-ed23-4308-ba04-82e9de91052c","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"同源策略提升了 Web 前端的安全性，但牺牲了 Web 拓展上的灵活性。设想若把 html、js、css、flash、image 等文件全部布置在一台服务器上，小网站这样凑活还行，大中网站如果这样做服务器根本受不了的。所以，现代浏览器在安全性和可用性之间选择了一个平衡点。在遵循同源策略的基础上，选择性地为同源策略开放了后门， 例如 img script style 等标签，都允许垮域引用资源，严格说这都是不符合同源要求的。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"911d23c3-84c7-4eb9-b80f-5af6472e8358","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"正是利用 script 等标签引用的资源没有同源策略的限制，我们可以通过 script 向服务器发送请求，而服务器返回一个回调，将数据作为参数返回，可能你现在不能明白是什么意思，看下面的代码，我们在页面中添加下面的内容","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2d563ea0-af0d-4b72-8981-d8503a0e34b6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"<script>\n    function getData(data) {\n        console.log(data);\n    }\n    // 创建一个 script 标签用以请求数据\n    let scriptElement = document.createElement('script');\n    // 设置请求的地址 并且设置了回调函数\n    scriptElement.src = 'http://127.0.0.1:4000?callback=getData';\n    // 这一步很重要，不设置的话浏览器会报错 Uncaught SyntaxError: Unexpected identifier\n    scriptElement.setAttribute('type', 'text/javascript');\n    // 将这个 script 标签添加到 body 中\n    document.getElementsByTagName('body')[0].appendChild(scriptElement);\n</script>","collabId":"786fbe14-4f32-40f3-bdd1-46753634ad00","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"e3fa08a4-6e02-4e64-ad35-1251b67bb83f","language":"HTML","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"fc4662fd-0a93-47d4-a760-dec577be7708"},{"children":[{"text":"Node 服务端的代码","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6c364e40-2485-40d2-ab31-661a632f7cbe","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const http = require('http');\nconst querystring = require('querystring');\n\nconst server = http.createServer();\n\nserver.on('request', function(req, res) {\n    let qs = querystring.parse(req.url.split('?')[1]); // 解析请求参数\n    \n    let data = \"Hello World\"; // 返回的数据\n    \n    // 一定要在 ${data} 两端加上双引号，否则浏览器得到的是 getData(Hello World)会报错\n    res.end(`${qs.callback}(\"${data}\")`); // 即getData(data)\n})\n\nserver.listen(4000, function() {\n    console.log('服务启动在4000端口...');\n})","collabId":"5360a77b-9b8f-4d06-9636-c5347f0bf503","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"5f004eb8-8828-4c0f-85b5-be54ea9a439e","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"0829c664-8f2f-4b2c-b4fa-e2784fa7d8bb"},{"children":[{"text":"结果如下","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d594e8a3-e2ab-4028-bd3a-f3439fa2e8ef","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"Hello World","collabId":"1fead7dc-dc8d-427d-a08e-90faa159b349","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"e69bdab3-4483-4b6f-b814-3f731db0ec08","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"bdfc7336-6598-43ee-8d4c-4b3a308a99be"},{"children":[{"text":"我来理一下上面的步骤","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"01a1f974-264b-4a25-b292-5e0b499f649f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"首先创建了一个函数 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"getData","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，该函数的作用是用来处理数据的，接收的那个参数就是数据","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"94d79870-62c9-4411-ace2-d7da7f274e84","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"function getData(data) {\n    console.log(data);\n}","collabId":"9efd8b97-724e-41d9-85ad-6c5f476a3817","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"db8f51cb-43dc-4a04-a175-42fed87522d6","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"bfd62a5c-61f9-4306-9009-684321e4b97e"}],"collabId":"33c10ff3-860f-4102-937c-f30de0d0350b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"创建一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"script","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 标签，并且设置了请求的地址，以及将处理数据函数的名称即 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"getData","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 作为参数传入","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cdfcc6bc-420a-49b8-8625-742084e3704a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"script.src = 'http://127.0.0.1:4000?callback=getData';","collabId":"9b604334-f63e-49fa-8dce-23295d0936b8","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"89e79bf7-c503-4ee0-96f1-9c37172f1d7c","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"9c4c4917-9548-4d63-9694-6d0f3870bb50"}],"collabId":"1627590d-6153-4a81-8611-e679dca55852","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"服务器接到请求，将要返回的数据作为传入的回调函数的参数传入","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"01828281-3700-476f-afa2-f3d3d8b8b31d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"res.end(`${qs.callback}(\"${data}\")`); // 即getData(data)","collabId":"4a82081a-a2ab-4110-a942-bee00129e4e0","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"a8b69cae-caf6-4f1c-a3fd-cd27289a5f87","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"cfaf9035-418e-478e-93b7-fb95384b8d92"}],"collabId":"fc80a7cf-6bba-4e99-836e-1e8c06bdbb58","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"script","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 标签得到服务器返回的数据，即 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"getData(\"Hello World\")","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，然后执行，这样数据 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Hello World","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 就作为参数传递给了 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"getData()","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9b437b1d-babc-46c9-92eb-4d127570da84","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"049db0d8-0a93-41c6-bf14-570225620d75","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"728d8024-5034-40da-bd1d-c29d9f8fc817","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","type":"numbered-list"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"text":"优点：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"900491d7-3cb6-4535-8334-dc5fa787eb44","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"使用简便，没有兼容性问题，是目前最流行的跨域方法","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6141519e-2dbc-4170-bd6c-5e2ca6ea51da","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"ece094bb-247f-4645-b998-22baa7a673a4","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"8a1cd15e-0239-44f6-a2c1-245a86e2a4e9","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"缺点：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5e3af42a-dd70-41eb-bb5b-cd6eb017e1b6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"只支持 GET 请求，并且代码是从其他域得到的，不排除可能有恶意代码，所以使用该方法，服务端必须确保值得信任","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9ad49b68-0aa5-4306-94a2-ceb013311b2e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"0edc0686-30c5-4928-b80e-e17d8463b323","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"要确定 JSONP 请求失败并不容易","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6a6160f9-34cd-43ab-a849-14de819c3ea0","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"248690ba-dd0b-4617-9fff-255578f5123e","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"23407e6f-e861-4f76-ae7d-2688bc56850c","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"collabId":"4c3b43bb-1e4a-4ac5-95d4-e8a860b2bb09","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"},{"children":[{"text":"CORS","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"17bbe31b-3661-4334-9418-07bbd9b65240","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"CORS(Cross-origin resource sharing，跨域资源共享) 是一个 W3C 标准，定义了在必须访问跨域资源时，浏览器与服务器应该如何沟通。CORS 背后的基本思想，就是使用自定义的 HTTP 头部让浏览器与服务器进行沟通，从而决定请求或响应是应该成功，还是应该失败。CORS 需要浏览器和服务器同时支持。目前，所有浏览器都支持该功能，IE 浏览器不能低于 IE10。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"fcf2fdc6-a720-4211-80af-2d053d691c3d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"对于开发者来说，我们只要正常的发出 ajax 请求即可，与之前没有任何区别，如","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b743c077-3c6f-4a9e-b9d2-290368dbaf28","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const xhr = new XMLHttpRequest();\nxhr.onreadystatechange = function () { \n    if (xhr.readyState == 4 && xhr.status == 200) {\n        console.log(xhr.responseText);\n    } \n }\n xhr.onerror = function() {\n     console.error('出错了')\n }\nxhr.open('get', 'http://127.0.0.1:4000');\nxhr.send(null);","collabId":"3c5d4efc-bbc6-4a76-93ab-656f8ec3c189","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"442ba375-432f-4d1f-a58d-8b091c3b294a","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"2b6bb200-bc76-40d4-99ab-841a06abe209"},{"children":[{"text":"但是在服务端，我们要设置一下信赖的请求来源，如下","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"89811464-1ebc-4635-befc-ecf0aac14469","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const http = require('http');\n\nconst server = http.createServer();\n\nserver.on('request', function(req, res) {\n    // 表示来自 http://127.0.0.1:5501 的请求可以拿到数据\n    res.setHeader('Access-Control-Allow-Origin', 'http://127.0.0.1:5501')\n    res.end('hello world');\n})\n\nserver.listen(4000, function() {\n    console.log('服务启动在4000端口...');\n})","collabId":"a1e10f73-0df6-423c-ba8f-26d3c26eb4f1","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"9a53afe6-7b42-440a-abf8-c2da47726cf7","language":"js","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"96e4841c-5a11-4132-a400-d03c4b170208"},{"children":[{"text":"除了可以设置请求来源，还可以设置允许的方法，允许的头部等等","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0ed37dc4-01ac-4ee2-bd49-515c3c682f92","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"响应头","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"56e7b509-29e7-404b-8662-8626f0375bfb","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"作用","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a5f76cd0-0f1e-49a7-b9e7-175041ad7202","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"}],"collabId":"95f78bd8-58bf-4397-b612-460aea863156","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","type":"table-row"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Origin","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"43c9f151-7fa4-4ab3-81bc-6caeda9b9742","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"设置允许的请求来源，如果允许任意来源，可以设置为 *","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"56bf8fbb-8c41-408a-840c-2cc3d2a82e74","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"}],"collabId":"cd8a92f1-734c-49f6-9048-bf8826d6c744","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","type":"table-row"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Methods","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2c40ea29-b5c2-4803-a43e-11c32b3826d4","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"允许的方法，多个以逗号分隔，如 GET, POST","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d340bc39-662d-4e73-a5b4-0dd55680d1dc","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"}],"collabId":"2bc92628-035c-45f2-9c4c-edf44e1eb5fd","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","type":"table-row"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Headers","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b19ddcd1-88f5-49c9-b283-1a02c4bb12ee","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"允许的请求头，多个以逗号分隔","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"79c52617-287c-488b-8a81-9fbe41dfcad0","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"}],"collabId":"9bb4b1e2-0a42-49e0-bc3c-53f1861ac2c5","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","type":"table-row"}],"collabId":"79165f80-2e93-43f2-91d8-a8f32a47d254","tauContract":"6b49184b8918108ccf1636963138d105f679894dfe0d7b7abd75a6e6db67056b","type":"table"},{"children":[{"text":"浏览器将 CORS 请求分为两类，分别为简单请求和非简单请求。如果满足以下两类请求，就是简单请求","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4cd12b2d-3c03-41a7-a767-6df7d83a686b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"请求方法是以下三种方法之一：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c5c0288e-846c-4853-a7c8-4b4f1da15fc2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"GET","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"790853c1-2e4a-46da-ae10-9f30d8d2ba2b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"903c4a77-9ae2-495a-af2a-e11e07c2ddd7","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"POST","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c4542e76-9980-472d-bdc6-9caf2021d9bc","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"4d17d61a-7d01-44a7-ab29-071fa701b1d2","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"HEAD","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c9a6de3a-57a0-40fd-848f-ac2d042e0f3e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"302cf704-b9de-4b10-8c58-3d5f62763c7e","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"9a0598b3-e97f-41cf-9433-395fc586f055","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"collabId":"4ec9bdd0-86eb-4351-b5ac-22ca8762eb29","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"HTTP的头信息不超出以下几种字段：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"135f4893-cfcb-4296-b468-7c9aaef90fb1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"Accept","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"16b098ae-4993-4968-9595-a4ffb2c79e4d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"389b8bea-efd8-43eb-900d-6357be85df7b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"Accept-Language","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0d969b6c-1f96-498a-8513-71da44ce575f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"a4da0410-7b2b-4edc-8bff-f70834bf5e90","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"Content-Language","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3b1833b7-f0d1-4e13-a079-50fdd1f3d821","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"984eedbf-45d0-4f4f-a082-9a56d78eddbe","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"Last-Event-ID","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3e8553b0-8f61-4218-a6f3-72d925250b47","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"a6876859-7344-4701-98f6-c6852440cf2c","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"Content-Type：只限于三个值 application/x-www-form-urlencoded、multipart/form-data、text/plain","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"888b8620-e027-4f11-97db-9aef4a3c1272","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"5b3ab673-c27e-40af-8130-3da1179f1791","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"5f4b0c4b-e692-4462-82ed-1497eb4f542d","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"collabId":"84999c66-ba84-4a20-9cda-d976411d4059","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"7d0b463d-f04d-481f-8619-4c68bcca8211","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","type":"numbered-list"},{"children":[{"text":"如果不满足以上的两大条件，那么就是非简单请求，而浏览器对于简单请求和非简单请求的处理是不一样的。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"263e0cde-fb65-4077-a6ca-d7a85ccf2d8d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"color":"hsl(270, 100%, 50%)","text":"简单请求","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6581a6ef-560e-4829-9452-fad7ce972501","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"在请求中需要附加一个额外的 Origin 头部，其中包含请求页面的源信息（协议、域名和端口），以便服务器根据这个头部信息来决定是否给予响应。例如：Origin: http://127.0.0.1:5501","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a1e2528b-1cbf-460c-a7c0-736b0b31f6f4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"1844b333-c10b-43fb-9fdc-1bd011dacfd1","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"如果服务器认为这个请求可以接受，就在 Access-Control-Allow-Origin 头部中回发相同的源信息(如果是公共资源，可以回发 *)，例如：Access-Control-Allow-Origin：http://127.0.0.1:5501","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"36de26f9-da71-4fb8-8ad1-a34d2390c594","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"f4edb757-448f-4783-93bd-3947c20ef6fe","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"没有这个头部或者有这个头部但源信息不匹配，浏览器就会驳回请求，注意，请求和响应都不包含 cookie 信息","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ee4fb735-15ae-4171-86d2-33c9454c07f1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0